#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.3 Step 2. Optimize circuits for quantum hardware execution "
"{#33-step-2-optimize-circuits-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"3.3 Langkah 2. Optimalkan Circuit untuk eksekusi di hardware kuantum "
"{#33-step-2-optimize-circuits-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The circuit above contains a series of abstractions useful to think about "
"quantum algorithms, but not possible to run on the hardware. To be able to "
"run on a QPU, the circuit needs to undergo a series of operations that make "
"up the **transpilation** or **circuit optimization** step of the pattern.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit di atas mengandung serangkaian abstraksi yang berguna untuk "
"memikirkan algoritma kuantum, tetapi tidak bisa langsung dijalankan di "
"hardware. Untuk bisa berjalan di QPU, Circuit perlu menjalani serangkaian "
"operasi yang membentuk langkah **transpilasi** atau **optimisasi Circuit** "
"dari pattern tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit library offers a series of **transpilation passes** that cater to"
" a wide range of circuit transformations. You need to make sure that your "
"circuit is **optimized** for your purpose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Library Qiskit menawarkan serangkaian **transpilation passes** yang melayani"
" berbagai macam transformasi Circuit. Kamu perlu memastikan Circuit kamu "
"**dioptimalkan** sesuai tujuan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation might involves several steps, such as:\n"
msgstr "Transpilasi mungkin melibatkan beberapa langkah, seperti:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Initial mapping** of the qubits in the circuit (such as decision "
"variables) to physical qubits on the device.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pemetaan awal** qubit dalam Circuit (seperti variabel keputusan) ke qubit "
"fisik di perangkat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Unrolling** of the instructions in the quantum circuit to the hardware-"
"native instructions that the backend understands.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Unrolling** instruksi dalam Circuit kuantum menjadi instruksi native "
"hardware yang dipahami Backend.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Routing** of any qubits in the circuit that interact to physical qubits "
"that are adjacent with one another.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Routing** qubit mana pun dalam Circuit yang berinteraksi ke qubit fisik "
"yang saling bertetangga satu sama lain.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Error suppression** by adding single-qubit gates to suppress noise with "
"dynamical decoupling.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Penekanan error** dengan menambahkan Gate satu qubit untuk menekan noise "
"dengan dynamical decoupling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"More information about transpilation is available in our "
"[documentation](/guides/transpile).\n"
msgstr ""
"Informasi lebih lanjut tentang transpilasi tersedia dalam "
"[dokumentasi](/guides/transpile) kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code transforms and optimizes the abstract circuit into a "
"format that is ready for execution on one of devices accessible through the "
"cloud using the **Qiskit IBM&reg; Runtime service**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode berikut mentransformasi dan mengoptimalkan Circuit abstrak menjadi "
"format yang siap dieksekusi di salah satu perangkat yang dapat diakses "
"melalui cloud menggunakan **layanan Qiskit IBM&reg; Runtime**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that you can test your programs locally by \"local testing mode\" before sending them to real quantum computers.\n"
"More information about the local testing mode is available in the [documentation.](/guides/local-testing-mode)\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu dicatat bahwa kamu bisa menguji program secara lokal dengan \"local testing mode\" sebelum mengirimnya ke komputer kuantum nyata.\n"
"Informasi lebih lanjut tentang local testing mode tersedia dalam [dokumentasi.](/guides/local-testing-mode)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/95cd3eed-0348-4373-b664-16a65d42f1e7-2.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/95cd3eed-0348-4373-b664-16a65d42f1e7-2.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.4 Step 3. Execute using Qiskit primitives {#34-step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr ""
"3.4 Langkah 3. Eksekusi menggunakan Qiskit primitives {#34-step-3-execute-"
"using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the QAOA workflow, the optimal QAOA parameters are found in an iterative "
"optimization loop, which runs a series of circuit evaluations and uses a "
"classical optimizer to find the optimal $\\beta_k$ and $\\gamma_k$ "
"parameters. This execution loop is executed via the following steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam alur kerja QAOA, parameter QAOA yang optimal ditemukan dalam loop "
"optimisasi iteratif, yang menjalankan serangkaian evaluasi Circuit dan "
"menggunakan optimizer klasik untuk menemukan parameter $\\beta_k$ dan "
"$\\gamma_k$ yang optimal. Loop eksekusi ini dijalankan melalui langkah-"
"langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Define the initial parameters\n"
msgstr "Tentukan parameter awal\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instantiate a new `Session` containing the optimization loop and the "
"primitive used to sample the circuit\n"
msgstr ""
"Instansiasi Session baru yang berisi loop optimisasi dan primitive yang "
"digunakan untuk mengambil sampel Circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once an optimal set of parameters is found, execute the circuit a final time"
" to obtain a final distribution which will be used in the post-process "
"step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah sekumpulan parameter yang optimal ditemukan, eksekusi Circuit sekali"
" lagi untuk mendapatkan distribusi akhir yang akan digunakan pada langkah "
"pasca-proses.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define circuit with initial parameters {#define-circuit-with-initial-"
"parameters}"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan Circuit dengan parameter awal {#define-circuit-with-initial-"
"parameters}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We start with arbitrary chosen parameters.\n"
msgstr "Kita mulai dengan parameter yang dipilih secara acak.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Define backend and execution primitive {#define-backend-and-execution-"
"primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan Backend dan primitive eksekusi {#define-backend-and-execution-"
"primitive}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the **Qiskit Runtime primitives** to interact with IBM&reg; backends. "
"The two primitives are Sampler and Estimator, and the choice of primitive "
"depends on what type of measurement you want to run on the quantum computer."
" For the minimization of $H_C$, use Estimator since the measurement of the "
"cost function is simply the expectation value of $\\langle H_C \\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan **Qiskit Runtime primitives** untuk berinteraksi dengan Backend "
"IBM&reg;. Dua primitive tersebut adalah Sampler dan Estimator, dan pilihan "
"primitive bergantung pada jenis pengukuran yang ingin kamu jalankan di "
"komputer kuantum. Untuk minimisasi $H_C$, gunakan Estimator karena "
"pengukuran fungsi biaya hanyalah nilai ekspektasi dari $\\langle H_C "
"\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run {#run}"
msgstr "Jalankan {#run}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The primitives offer a variety of [execution modes](/guides/execution-modes) to schedule workloads on quantum devices, and a QAOA workflow runs iteratively in a session.\n"
"![\"execution mode\"](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/execution-mode.avif)\n"
"You can plug the sampler-based cost function into the SciPy minimizing routine to find the optimal parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitive menawarkan berbagai [mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes) untuk menjadwalkan beban kerja di perangkat kuantum, dan alur kerja QAOA berjalan secara iteratif dalam sebuah Session.\n"
"![\"execution mode\"](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/execution-mode.avif)\n"
"Kamu bisa menghubungkan fungsi biaya berbasis Sampler ke dalam rutinitas minimisasi SciPy untuk menemukan parameter yang optimal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The optimizer was able to reduce the cost and find better parameters for the"
" circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Optimizer berhasil mengurangi biaya dan menemukan parameter yang lebih baik "
"untuk Circuit tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/f923dd5d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/f923dd5d-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have found the optimal parameters for the circuit, you can assign "
"these parameters and sample the final distribution obtained with the "
"optimized parameters. Here is where the *Sampler* primitive should be used "
"since it is the probability distribution of bitstring measurements which "
"correspond to the optimal cut of the graph.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah menemukan parameter yang optimal untuk Circuit, kamu bisa menetapkan"
" parameter-parameter ini dan mengambil sampel distribusi akhir yang "
"diperoleh dengan parameter yang sudah dioptimalkan. Di sinilah primitive "
"*Sampler* harus digunakan karena distribusi probabilitas pengukuran "
"bitstring yang berkorespondensi dengan potongan optimal dari graf.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** This means preparing a quantum state $\\psi$ in the computer and "
"then measuring it. A measurement will collapse the state into a single "
"computational basis state - for example, `010101110000...` - which "
"corresponds to a candidate solution $x$ to our initial optimization problem "
"($\\max f(x)$ or $\\min f(x)$ depending on the task).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Catatan:** Ini berarti mempersiapkan keadaan kuantum $\\psi$ di komputer "
"lalu mengukurnya. Sebuah pengukuran akan meruntuhkan keadaan menjadi satu "
"keadaan basis komputasi — misalnya, `010101110000...` — yang "
"berkorespondensi dengan kandidat solusi $x$ untuk masalah optimisasi awal "
"kita ($\\max f(x)$ atau $\\min f(x)$ tergantung tugasnya).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/f8dddf5a-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/f8dddf5a-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3.5 Step 4. Post-process, return result in classical format "
"{#35-step-4-post-process-return-result-in-classical-format}"
msgstr ""
"3.5 Langkah 4. Pasca-proses, kembalikan hasil dalam format klasik "
"{#35-step-4-post-process-return-result-in-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The post-processing step interprets the sampling output to return a solution"
" for your original problem. In this case, you are interested in the "
"bitstring with the highest probability as this determines the optimal cut. "
"The symmetries in the problem allow for four possible solutions, and the "
"sampling process will return one of them with a slightly higher probability,"
" but you can see in the plotted distribution below that four of the "
"bitstrings are distinctively more likely than the rest.\n"
msgstr ""
"Langkah pasca-proses menginterpretasikan output pengambilan sampel untuk "
"mengembalikan solusi bagi masalah asal kamu. Dalam kasus ini, kamu tertarik "
"pada bitstring dengan probabilitas tertinggi karena ini menentukan potongan "
"yang optimal. Simetri dalam masalah memungkinkan empat kemungkinan solusi, "
"dan proses pengambilan sampel akan mengembalikan salah satunya dengan "
"probabilitas yang sedikit lebih tinggi, tetapi kamu bisa melihat dalam "
"distribusi yang diplot di bawah bahwa empat dari bitstring tersebut secara "
"jelas lebih mungkin daripada yang lainnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/32a3020e-c1ea-4aff-988c-d7910a690fa8-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/32a3020e-c1ea-4aff-988c-d7910a690fa8-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize best cut {#visualize-best-cut}"
msgstr "Visualisasi potongan terbaik {#visualize-best-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the optimal bit string, you can then visualize this cut on the original"
" graph.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dari bitstring yang optimal, kamu kemudian bisa memvisualisasikan potongan "
"ini pada graf aslinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/22a48124-e6b4-4144-bee1-f01fa4c7ccbb-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/variational-quantum-algorithms/extracted-"
"outputs/22a48124-e6b4-4144-bee1-f01fa4c7ccbb-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And calculate the value of the cut. The solution is not optimal due to noise"
" (the cut value of the optimal solution is 5).\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan hitung nilai potongan tersebut. Solusinya tidak optimal karena adanya "
"noise (nilai potongan dari solusi optimal adalah 5).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This concludes the small-scale QAOA tutorial.\n"
"You will learn how to adapt QAOA at a utility-scale in \"Part 2: scale it up!\" of the [Quantum approximate optimization algorithm](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm) tutorial.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mengakhiri tutorial QAOA skala kecil.\n"
"Kamu akan belajar cara mengadaptasi QAOA pada skala utilitas dalam \"Part 2: scale it up!\" dari tutorial [Quantum approximate optimization algorithm](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm).\n"
